          "width": 879,
          "height": 1203,
          "mimeType": "image/jpeg",
          "license": "Public domain",
          "artist": "Artist: Eduardo Chiossone (1833–98); Photographer: Maruki Riyō (also misspelt as Maruki Toshiaki)[3]",
